{"id":"prepositions-0049","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 49","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Doctors say stress is a major cause ___ insomnia.","hint":"cause ___ sth","explanation":"the cause OF something."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s perfectly capable ___ managing the project alone.","hint":"capable ___ doing","explanation":"capable OF doing something."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They accused him ___ lying to the committee.","hint":"accuse sb ___ sth","explanation":"accuse somebody OF something/doing something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Critics attacked the film ___ its slow pace.","hint":"criticise sth ___ sth","explanation":"criticise/criticize something FOR a reason."},{"answer":"at","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"We arrived ___ the airport two hours early.","hint":"arrive ___ (place), ___ (city)","explanation":"arrive AT a point (airport, hotel), IN a city/country."},{"answer":"with","accept":[],"options":["from","by","of","with"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The lake teems ___ trout in early summer.","hint":"teem ___ = be full of","explanation":"\u0027Teem with\u0027 = be full of living things moving about."},{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They arrived ___ Rome at dawn.","hint":"arrive ___ (place), ___ (city)","explanation":"arrive IN towns, cities and countries; AT for buildings/points."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They\u0027re ashamed ___ their behaviour at the match.","hint":"ashamed ___ sth","explanation":"ashamed OF something/doing something."}]}